  "content": "<div>\n<div><strong>自1.3版本起新增了白名单与黑名单功能，使用物品标签\"randomore:randomore_blacklist\"和\"randomore:randomore_whitelist\"，并在1.6版本中通过战利品表进行了重构</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>本模组添加了一种会掉落随机物品的矿石。同时兼容其他模组。</div>\n<div><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/deepslate_random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/netherrack_random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"><img src=\"http://nottouchedgrass.com/files/site/mods/RandomOre/end_stone_random_ore_nobg.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></div>\n<div>可自由用于整合包中！</div>\n</div>",
